{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/26328-so-land-of-eight-million-dreams","id":26328,"title":"So Land of Eight Million Dreams....","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-08T23:26:15-08:00","id":26328,"title":"So Land of Eight Million Dreams....","content":"recently took a look at it and found it to a pretty good take on eastern &quot;fae&quot;. Who else enjoyed it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1268-cosmic-mind","name":"Cosmic Mind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1268_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-09T02:45:25-08:00","id":26385,"title":"","content":"I really liked it. I wish that the concept had been a bit broader than just the East and we had seen those guys in other parts of the world (but then I felt that way about some of the other Eastern-only splats). Still a pretty small complaint. <br /> <br /> Oh, and we never really got any stats on Hoc Tao, the evil power used by the Kura Sau. About the only two issues I had with them. <br /> <br /> I did really like their power-set.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T05:06:12-08:00","id":27903,"title":"","content":"I thought this book was an amazing hidden gem! It seems potentially greater then some of the main lines! I really wonder where they could give it the love KotE got!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T20:04:50-08:00","id":29110,"title":"","content":"I felt it was a jumbled mess, with a handful of interesting ideas executed poorly. Most damningly, it wasn't a <i>Changeling</i> book, no matter what the logo on the cover says. Hsien do not gather glamour, are unaffected by banality or the Mists, and have less link to the Dreaming than they do to the Umbra or the Underworld. They are an exotic breed of body-snatching Umbrood, and really have no narrative points of overlap with the rest of the Changeling line. Introducing them into a regular Changeling chronicle (or introducing Changelings into a Hsien chronicle) is certainly possible, to the same extent that introducing any of the other outside splat to a Changeling chronicle is possible. Kithain have no more <i>inherent</i> reason to encounter or interact with these creatures than they do with Kuei-Jin, or Mummies, or Rokea, or whatever.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please add signature.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/615-the-hanged-man","name":"The Hanged Man","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-22T12:08:33-08:00","id":35051,"title":"","content":"I'm a big fan the this book! Yeah, not very Changeling related though. I'm rather fond of the powers too, despite certain mechanical wonkiness. Also, the sidebar that says PCs should never be THIS powerful can go die horribly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/167-nikink","name":"nikink","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-22T17:57:56-08:00","id":35227,"title":"","content":"Like many books made for the Changeling system towards the end of its abandonment, this book definitely has the traits of being compiled on a deadline that really didn't give it time to be blended into the rest of the system. Several books suffered from this messy problem, but the ideas it presented were too good to leave behind in obscurity like the Book of Glamour. I'm glad it was released as a part of the Changelingverse, but it did not get the attention in development that could have made it more relatable to the rest of the system. Again, we can only hope that once the 20th anniversary comes around, a part of this supplement can be included in the final edition, or in a secondary collection. (Dreams Across the World?)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-22T21:54:20-08:00","id":35372,"title":"","content":"I would love a revision and expansion of this gameline.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}